        "2. Cancel 16! with denominator.",
        "3. Remaining: (18 × 17) / 18 = 17.",
        "4. Trap: Cancel before multiplying large numbers."
      ],
      "fastStrategy": "Write factorials to cancel common terms; avoid huge arithmetic."
